[2026-03-16T01:41:21.908Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019ZFhiq3FASdg1n41XBSME9","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have found all the information needed. Here's my final report:\n\n## Summary\n\n**1) Full App Directory Path:**\n```\n/repo/apps/LinearClone\n```\n\n**2) Full Test File Contents:**\n\nThe test file is located at `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/create-issue-modal-actions-integration.spec.ts` and contains 495 lines of Playwright integration tests for the CreateIssueModalActions component. It includes the following test cases:\n\n- Create Issue button is visible and styled\n- Cancel button is visible\n- Cancel button closes the modal\n- Cancel button discards form data\n- Create Issue button submits the form with all fields\n- Create Issue with only required fields\n- Created issue appears in the team issues list\n- Created issue with parent appears as sub-issue\n- Created issue generates activity history entry\n- Create Issue button is disabled during submission\n- Clicking outside the modal closes it\n- Pressing Escape closes the modal\n- Creating multiple issues in sequence works correctly\n- Created issue generates inbox notification for assignee\n\nThe tests use several helper functions to handle authentication via API, team navigation, and modal interaction, with extensive use of Playwright test IDs for element selection.\n\n**3) Relevant Section from tests.md:**\n\nThe corresponding section is in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` starting at line 1376, under the \"### CreateIssueActions\" heading. This section documents test cases covering:\n\n- Create Issue button visibility and styling\n- Cancel button functionality\n- Form submission with all fields\n- Required fields only submission\n- Issue list updates\n- Parent issue/sub-issue relationships\n- Activity history generation\n- Inbox notifications for assignees\n- Button disabled state during submission\n- Modal closure via overlay click and Escape key\n- Multiple sequential issue creation\n- Modal reset behavior between submissions"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a61fe5539d658ea1b (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 34836\ntool_uses: 11\nduration_ms: 24357</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1e17ab70-0a33-4d2a-af23-66b102e400e2","uuid":"aaab6e26-228c-47c1-9678-65e440c90dc6","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app directory that contains tests/create-issue-modal-actions-integration.spec.ts. Search in /repo/apps/. Also read that test file and find the corresponding tests.md file in the app. Return: 1) The full app directory path 2) The full test file contents 3) The relevant section from tests.md for this test","agentId":"a61fe5539d658ea1b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have found all the information needed. Here's my final report:\n\n## Summary\n\n**1) Full App Directory Path:**\n```\n/repo/apps/LinearClone\n```\n\n**2) Full Test File Contents:**\n\nThe test file is located at `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/create-issue-modal-actions-integration.spec.ts` and contains 495 lines of Playwright integration tests for the CreateIssueModalActions component. It includes the following test cases:\n\n- Create Issue button is visible and styled\n- Cancel button is visible\n- Cancel button closes the modal\n- Cancel button discards form data\n- Create Issue button submits the form with all fields\n- Create Issue with only required fields\n- Created issue appears in the team issues list\n- Created issue with parent appears as sub-issue\n- Created issue generates activity history entry\n- Create Issue button is disabled during submission\n- Clicking outside the modal closes it\n- Pressing Escape closes the modal\n- Creating multiple issues in sequence works correctly\n- Created issue generates inbox notification for assignee\n\nThe tests use several helper functions to handle authentication via API, team navigation, and modal interaction, with extensive use of Playwright test IDs for element selection.\n\n**3) Relevant Section from tests.md:**\n\nThe corresponding section is in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` starting at line 1376, under the \"### CreateIssueActions\" heading. This section documents test cases covering:\n\n- Create Issue button visibility and styling\n- Cancel button functionality\n- Form submission with all fields\n- Required fields only submission\n- Issue list updates\n- Parent issue/sub-issue relationships\n- Activity history generation\n- Inbox notifications for assignees\n- Button disabled state during submission\n- Modal closure via overlay click and Escape key\n- Multiple sequential issue creation\n- Modal reset behavior between submissions"}],"totalDurationMs":24357,"totalTokens":34836,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5043,"cache_read_input_tokens":29379,"output_tokens":414,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5043},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
